OL,3,AHong Kong's Tiananmen activists
OL,4,Asentenced to up to seven years in
OL,5,Aprison
OL,6,
OL,7,FHong Kong and Macau were for years the
OL,8,Fonly places on Chinese soil where
OL,9,Fpeople could hold gatherings to mark
OL,10,Fthe Tiananmen crackdown - a highly
OL,11,Fsensitive and heavily censored topic in
OL,12,Fmainland China.
